00:13:14,664 --> 00:13:17,664
All I know is that it's there.

275
00:13:17,664 --> 00:13:20,664
Where is the gift shop?

276
00:13:20,664 --> 00:13:23,664
I want a Salvovo on Silver Street.

277
00:13:23,664 --> 00:13:25,664
Oh, there?

278
00:13:25,664 --> 00:13:28,664
Oh, the pumpkin shop?

279
00:13:28,664 --> 00:13:32,664
They have a pumpkin shop.

280
00:13:32,664 --> 00:13:36,664
I'd like to go into the gift shop here.

281
00:13:37,472 --> 00:13:39,472
Is this a good place?

282
00:13:42,586 --> 00:13:44,586
I bought a salvo!

283
00:13:44,586 --> 00:13:46,586
Yay!

284
00:13:46,586 --> 00:13:48,586
I bought some for Yuruki and Haru too, so I'm going to amiage

285
00:13:48,586 --> 00:13:50,586
Well then, let's get on with it

286
00:13:50,586 --> 00:13:52,586
I'm going for the bread!

287
00:13:52,586 --> 00:13:54,586
Hurry up, hurry up!

288
00:13:54,586 --> 00:13:56,586
Oh, that and hiroshige

