It's unmanned and open 24 hours.

293
00:14:04,586 --> 00:14:06,586
Yes, right here.

294
00:14:06,586 --> 00:14:08,586
I'm Mr. Hiroshige.

295
00:14:08,586 --> 00:14:10,586
Hi.

296
00:14:10,586 --> 00:14:12,586
Good morning.

297
00:14:12,656 --> 00:14:14,656
What's this place?

298
