310
00:14:38,506 --> 00:14:40,506
A thousand yen bill.

311
00:14:40,506 --> 00:14:42,506
May I?

312
00:14:44,506 --> 00:14:46,506
Rumble, rattle, rattle!

313
00:14:46,506 --> 00:14:50,506
Put a 1,000 yen bill in a piece of bread.

314
00:14:50,506 --> 00:14:52,506
